# A walker who sees you coming steps aside. On Valencia's west sidewalk a walker heads north; you
# roll at them head-on at 6 m/s along their line. Closing on them within 1.3 s, in their view, they
# step 1.1 m to their left (pedStep) and you go by 1.1 m off: a NEAR MISS (250), not a hit.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 ped at -65.5 -270 356
cmd 1 teleport -66.06 -256 2.48 175.66
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 0.4536
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -5.983
run 360
expect peds.alive == 1 at 2
expect event pedStep{side=1.1} within 108..112
expect peds.aside == 1 at 200
expect event nearMiss{points=250,distance=1.1} within 254..258
expect event comboLanded{name=NEAR MISS,points=250} within 266..270
expect peds.aside == 0 at 360
expect no event pedHit
expect no event bail
